description:
Write a parser for JSON, the data format every web API uses.

```
{"name": "Ada", "langs": ["Python", "C"], "age": 36, "active": true, "boss": null}
-> Object { name: String("Ada"), langs: Array([...]), age: Number(36.0), ... }
error at line 3, column 14: expected ',' or '}'
```

starter.main.rs:
#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq)]
enum Json {
    Null,
    Bool(bool),
    Number(f64),
}

fn main() {
    println!("{:?}", Json::Number(36.0));
}
